# Git ignore rules for this repo only. chezmoi skips files starting with "." in
# its source folder, so this is never copied into the home folder.

# Plain-text private files (e.g. a generated env.private). The templates that
# produce them end in .tmpl and are not matched. Same rule as the global
# ~/.gitignore (dot_gitignore), repeated here so it travels with the repo.
*.private
